WEBVTT

01:49.970 --> 01:53.950
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.180 --> 01:56.860
[Episode 14]

02:09.360 --> 02:11.030
I got drunk and blacked out?

02:26.430 --> 02:28.310
I ate poisonous mushrooms

02:28.310 --> 02:29.750
and got mildly poisoned?

02:39.030 --> 02:39.840
Mr. Xiao,

02:40.280 --> 02:42.470
s-sorry for the trouble last night.

02:42.470 --> 02:44.200
Are the other colleagues okay?

02:44.350 --> 02:45.150
They're fine.

02:49.870 --> 02:50.670
Well...

02:51.550 --> 02:54.550
I didn't do anything inappropriate
last night, did I?

02:55.000 --> 02:57.360
In such a hurry
to clear yourself of it, huh?

02:57.360 --> 02:58.420
It's not like that.

02:58.550 --> 03:00.320
I just completely blacked out.

03:02.350 --> 03:03.860
Did I curse at you?

03:04.240 --> 03:04.750
No.

03:07.450 --> 03:08.450
I hit you?

03:11.310 --> 03:11.960
I'm sorry, Mr. Xiao.

03:11.960 --> 03:13.710
I really can't recall anything.

03:13.710 --> 03:15.190
If you're upset about it,

03:15.190 --> 03:16.850
you can hit me back if you want.

03:18.840 --> 03:19.570
Are you sure?

03:38.079 --> 03:38.870
Dream on.

03:40.190 --> 03:41.190
I'm going out for a while.

03:41.190 --> 03:42.590
Remember to eat it later.

03:42.900 --> 03:44.960
He could at least eat before leaving.

03:46.170 --> 03:47.970
What delicious food did he make?

04:00.190 --> 04:00.990
You're awake?

04:02.710 --> 04:03.710
Go get some more sleep.

04:03.710 --> 04:04.710
It's still early.

04:06.240 --> 04:07.120
No way.

04:07.120 --> 04:09.310
I thought of some desserts last night.

04:09.310 --> 04:11.570
I need to give them a try
at the shop today.

04:12.380 --> 04:13.950
Why am I feeling so drowsy?

04:15.710 --> 04:16.800
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

04:16.800 --> 04:18.130
I'm helping you wake up.

04:26.770 --> 04:27.650
Here it comes.

04:39.390 --> 04:40.159
Boss.

04:42.170 --> 04:44.830
My mom sent you
these eight-treasure pastries.

04:45.590 --> 04:47.230
Did your mom visit your place?

04:47.230 --> 04:49.630
No, she had them delivered to me
by FlashEx.

04:51.159 --> 04:51.800
I see.

04:52.130 --> 04:53.970
After all, you have someone
living at your place now.

04:53.970 --> 04:55.680
That's just my regular roommate.

04:55.680 --> 04:57.040
I never said otherwise.

04:57.950 --> 04:59.550
I'll text your mom on WeChat.

04:59.560 --> 05:01.190
Mrs. Bai, I received the pastries.

05:01.190 --> 05:02.190
Thank you so much.

05:02.310 --> 05:03.970
I haven't even tried them yet.

05:06.310 --> 05:08.360
Now that the Design Competition is over,

05:08.360 --> 05:10.270
I feel so empty inside.

05:10.270 --> 05:11.310
I can tell.

05:11.870 --> 05:14.070
You're showing up here from time to time.

05:14.070 --> 05:15.390
I can't keep you company tonight.

05:15.390 --> 05:16.870
Wang is clocking out early today.

05:16.870 --> 05:18.600
We're having dinner together.

05:19.070 --> 05:22.130
The two of us haven't
had a proper meal together in ages.

05:22.390 --> 05:23.120
I understand.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.750
First come, first served.

05:26.240 --> 05:27.270
I fully understand.

05:27.270 --> 05:27.950
How about this?

05:27.950 --> 05:28.800
In order to make it up to you,

05:28.800 --> 05:30.750
I'll treat you to a murder mystery game.

05:30.750 --> 05:31.410
No, thanks.

05:31.560 --> 05:33.310
You can go play with Li Yue.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.800
I heard they're
having special events these days.

05:34.800 --> 05:37.720
I'm wondering where they get
all these creative ideas from.

05:37.720 --> 05:38.380
No worries,

05:38.480 --> 05:39.390
I have coupons.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.680
Three.

05:42.430 --> 05:43.270
Two.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.159
One.

05:45.360 --> 05:48.020
He comes to buy coffee
at this time every day now.

05:49.480 --> 05:50.680
Oh, you're here, too!

05:52.430 --> 05:53.240
The usual?

05:53.830 --> 05:54.510
The usual.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.120
Okay.

05:55.430 --> 05:55.960
Alright.

05:56.800 --> 05:58.040
The promotional leaflets
have all been handed out.

05:58.040 --> 05:59.510
Remember to give me the coupons later.

05:59.510 --> 06:00.190
No problem.

06:02.600 --> 06:05.400
When did you two
form this strategic partnership?

06:07.480 --> 06:08.600
It's nothing like that.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.390
I'm simply

06:09.390 --> 06:10.390
helping Li Yue meet

06:10.390 --> 06:12.050
his promotional KPI targets.

06:16.310 --> 06:17.390
Your next round is about to kick off.

06:17.390 --> 06:18.390
You should go now.

06:20.310 --> 06:21.070
See you.

06:21.200 --> 06:21.760
Bye-bye.

06:28.360 --> 06:29.430
Song Lina,

06:29.750 --> 06:32.000
a spy funded by a mysterious person.

06:32.510 --> 06:34.070
Your first mission is

06:34.190 --> 06:35.920
to stop the new Commander
from entering the city.

06:35.920 --> 06:36.430
Look!

06:36.430 --> 06:38.560
It's actually Qin Xiaoyi from Group A!

06:39.550 --> 06:40.260
Group A?

06:40.800 --> 06:42.000
So he ended up here?

06:42.750 --> 06:44.210
It's actually Qin Xiaoyi!

06:53.480 --> 06:54.870
This look is

06:55.530 --> 06:56.650
quite dope.

07:02.830 --> 07:03.390
Hold on.

07:04.290 --> 07:06.120
I remember I have a mission.

07:08.920 --> 07:09.830
Commander Qin!

07:10.070 --> 07:11.270
Please wait a moment!

07:17.950 --> 07:18.720
My dad...

07:20.160 --> 07:22.240
My father was wrongfully imprisoned.

07:22.240 --> 07:24.120
He's suffering greatly from illness now.

07:24.120 --> 07:25.630
Commander, please help me

07:25.630 --> 07:27.290
deliver this medicine to him.

07:27.480 --> 07:28.240
I

07:28.670 --> 07:30.070
cannot do you this favor.

07:36.630 --> 07:38.360
What kind of attitude was that?

07:38.510 --> 07:40.840
Is it because of what happened last night?

07:41.830 --> 07:43.920
What on earth happened last night?

07:44.159 --> 07:44.830
Miss Song,

07:45.710 --> 07:47.110
I have something for you.

07:51.190 --> 07:51.920
Here you are.

07:53.580 --> 07:55.340
How did I not notice before

07:55.360 --> 07:57.070
that there was sponsorship here?

07:57.070 --> 07:58.380
Even when drinking water,

07:58.380 --> 08:00.180
you should also stay observant.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.430
Miss Song,

08:04.600 --> 08:06.390
see you at the ballroom at 9 tonight.

08:06.390 --> 08:08.400
Your ex-lover will invite you to dance.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.950
Please help him win the position of mayor.

08:09.950 --> 08:11.380
Ex-lover?

08:12.040 --> 08:13.100
How melodramatic.

08:33.200 --> 08:34.510
Is he

08:34.700 --> 08:35.580
my ex-lover?

08:49.660 --> 08:51.070
No way...

09:05.910 --> 09:06.670
Miss Song,

09:07.800 --> 09:09.320
shall we dance?

09:20.780 --> 09:23.000
You're such a master
of switching moods, Commander.

09:23.000 --> 09:25.550
You were so aloof to me
on the street earlier.

09:25.790 --> 09:27.720
And now you've invited me to dance.

09:29.150 --> 09:30.150
You're way better

09:30.240 --> 09:31.770
than me at switching moods.

09:32.550 --> 09:33.200
Nonsense.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.790
I'm always steadfast in principles

09:36.000 --> 09:38.060
and consistent in ideas and actions.

09:38.330 --> 09:40.190
Consistent in ideas and actions?

09:40.400 --> 09:41.350
Does that mean

09:41.370 --> 09:43.630
you do everything following your heart?

09:47.410 --> 09:48.080
Yes.

09:50.720 --> 09:51.320
By the way,

09:51.710 --> 09:53.370
give me that medicine bottle.

09:53.630 --> 09:55.670
You just rejected me on the street.

09:56.320 --> 09:58.380
There were too many people watching.

09:58.580 --> 10:00.840
I couldn't tell if they were good or evil.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.350
Give me the medicine bottle.

10:02.350 --> 10:04.610
I will find a way
to send it to your father.

10:04.870 --> 10:05.960
I'm not

10:05.960 --> 10:07.820
like some irresponsible people.

10:10.150 --> 10:11.000
Qin Xiaoyi.

10:19.870 --> 10:21.130
Oh, no, it's a dead end.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.930
Find that person at all costs!

10:22.960 --> 10:23.820
Hurry and hide!

10:25.670 --> 10:26.330
Get in here.

10:28.840 --> 10:29.870
Go check inside!

10:44.120 --> 10:44.670
Let's go

10:44.800 --> 10:45.800
check over there.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.270
Is he gone?

10:55.320 --> 10:56.000
Well, then,

10:56.870 --> 10:58.400
can you make some space now?

11:02.870 --> 11:03.910
Desperate times
call for desperate measures.

11:03.910 --> 11:06.040
I'm not taking advantage of you, okay?

11:06.670 --> 11:08.000
It wouldn't be the first time anyway.

11:08.000 --> 11:09.720
Watch your language. When did I ever...

11:09.720 --> 11:10.320
Watch out.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.860
Actually, there's something

11:22.030 --> 11:23.490
I've always wanted to say.

11:25.910 --> 11:27.150
You have

11:26.860 --> 11:31.230
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

11:27.470 --> 11:29.110
a really good-looking face.

11:30.420 --> 11:31.020
Wait.

11:37.670 --> 11:38.730
Don't get me wrong.

11:39.030 --> 11:40.600
That night, I was hallucinating

11:40.600 --> 11:41.910
due to those mushrooms.

11:41.910 --> 11:42.480
I was

11:42.480 --> 11:44.080
not sober and made a mistake.

11:44.660 --> 11:46.520
Anyway, don't take anything I did

11:46.980 --> 11:48.010
seriously.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.760
Of course not.

11:53.840 --> 11:55.370
If I had taken it seriously.

11:55.440 --> 11:57.570
I wouldn't be standing here right now.

11:57.840 --> 11:59.500
So... Let's move on from this.

12:02.490 --> 12:02.970
Where

12:03.000 --> 12:04.210
are you going next?

12:04.680 --> 12:05.810
To find Feng Youjin.

12:13.080 --> 12:15.360
Here's all the intelligence
Feng Youjin needs.

12:15.360 --> 12:16.320
If you want to seek cooperation with him,

12:16.320 --> 12:17.650
it should come in handy.

12:20.670 --> 12:21.400
I'm leaving.

12:29.260 --> 12:31.380
What on earth did I do?

12:46.440 --> 12:47.240
Honey.

12:51.120 --> 12:53.510
My husband is home so early today.

12:54.870 --> 12:56.200
Zhan Jie is taking my shift tonight.

12:56.200 --> 12:57.990
I came home in a hurry to get some rest.

12:57.990 --> 12:59.790
He'll probably stay up all night.

12:59.790 --> 13:00.440
It's going to be exhausting.

13:00.440 --> 13:01.550
Let me order some food for him.

13:01.550 --> 13:03.480
No need. I've ordered some for him.

13:07.790 --> 13:08.550
Tired?

13:10.980 --> 13:13.200
Let me show you
the account I've been working on.

13:13.200 --> 13:15.130
It's gained quite a few followers.

13:17.120 --> 13:19.070
101 followers?

13:19.400 --> 13:19.880
Yep.

13:20.510 --> 13:21.390
So what?

13:21.390 --> 13:24.790
With 7 more, they could play
the 108 heroes in "Water Margin."

13:25.030 --> 13:25.750
Fine.

13:26.310 --> 13:27.990
I'll ask some colleagues of mine tomorrow

13:27.990 --> 13:29.650
to fulfill your heroic dream.

13:34.230 --> 13:34.990
Is this it?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.200
This, too?

14:17.600 --> 14:19.730
Last night, I tried to contact Zhan Jie

14:20.670 --> 14:22.440
to help me fix a bug,

14:23.360 --> 14:25.320
but I couldn't get through to him.

14:25.600 --> 14:27.660
This wasn't the first time recently.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.600
Aren't you two good friends?

14:31.190 --> 14:32.450
What's wrong with him?

14:33.360 --> 14:35.080
I really don't know.

14:35.770 --> 14:36.480
But

14:36.510 --> 14:38.300
if there's any bug you want to fix,

14:38.300 --> 14:39.720
you can ask me to do it as well.

14:39.720 --> 14:40.240
Yes.

14:40.630 --> 14:43.160
You were the first one
who popped into my mind.

14:44.320 --> 14:45.270
However,

14:46.390 --> 14:47.120
someone told me

14:47.120 --> 14:49.390
that you've been
working extra hours outside a lot lately.

14:49.390 --> 14:51.520
So you might not have time to come over.

14:52.240 --> 14:53.030
Guangming,

14:54.060 --> 14:55.590
you've been working for me,

14:56.000 --> 14:57.300
and I've treated you well, right?

14:57.300 --> 14:58.790
If you want to venture out on your own,

14:58.790 --> 14:59.520
that's fine.

14:59.750 --> 15:02.030
We can have a proper farewell party.

15:03.390 --> 15:05.120
But you can't take outside jobs

15:05.200 --> 15:07.080
while still getting paid by me.

15:07.670 --> 15:09.070
That's simply improper,

15:09.250 --> 15:10.370
right?

15:13.360 --> 15:15.160
You have indeed treated me well.

15:15.550 --> 15:18.150
The business trips were
always assigned to me.

15:18.160 --> 15:20.960
I needed to be gone
for at least 2 months every time.

15:21.290 --> 15:23.350
I assisted with every major project,

15:23.500 --> 15:24.720
but when it came to payment,

15:24.720 --> 15:26.600
suddenly I was counted
as "a friend helping out."

15:26.600 --> 15:28.560
My phone must be on 24 hours a day,

15:28.810 --> 15:30.470
just waiting for your orders.

15:30.870 --> 15:32.270
Honestly, I really don't

15:33.490 --> 15:35.620
want to live this kind of life anymore.

15:39.670 --> 15:40.590
What are you doing?

15:40.590 --> 15:42.990
I'll make sure the handover goes smoothly.

15:53.740 --> 15:55.460
Honey, what brings you here?

16:00.720 --> 16:02.780
These are all your favorites, right?

16:03.300 --> 16:05.270
These shops are quite far from each other.

16:05.270 --> 16:06.720
Didn't you just get off work?

16:06.720 --> 16:08.260
How did you find time
to go to all these places?

16:08.260 --> 16:09.670
I was working outside the office today.

16:09.670 --> 16:11.130
A client came to Shanghai.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.660
I took him around the city.

16:19.350 --> 16:20.710
Don't you want to ask me

16:21.120 --> 16:22.120
about how everything's going

16:22.120 --> 16:23.480
with our company?

16:23.950 --> 16:25.930
Didn't you promise
you wouldn't let the project fail?

16:25.930 --> 16:27.410
I believe you, of course.

16:27.600 --> 16:30.800
I was afraid that asking too much
would add to your stress.

16:32.180 --> 16:33.360
Don't just sit there.

16:33.360 --> 16:34.360
Have some food, too.

16:34.360 --> 16:35.220
I'm not hungry.

16:35.240 --> 16:37.390
I need to go back to the office
to meet with Zhan Jie.

16:37.390 --> 16:39.360
You still have something to work on?

16:39.360 --> 16:40.390
It's almost done.

16:41.200 --> 16:42.800
Once we officially sign the contract

16:42.800 --> 16:45.330
and hand over the project
to that big company,

16:45.450 --> 16:47.180
everything will be wrapped up.

16:48.670 --> 16:49.390
Okay.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.240
Soon.

16:55.750 --> 16:56.550
There you are.

16:59.750 --> 17:01.010
I just wandered around

17:01.040 --> 17:02.280
and bought you a gift.

17:02.600 --> 17:03.550
I haven't

17:03.680 --> 17:05.960
bought you anything in the past few years.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.420
I don't wear these things.

17:07.440 --> 17:08.770
Don't waste your money.

17:09.109 --> 17:10.480
It's just a small gift.

17:11.109 --> 17:12.170
Tomorrow morning,

17:12.200 --> 17:13.260
I'll go pick you up.

17:13.310 --> 17:15.099
I've got everything ready
for the grave visit.

17:15.099 --> 17:17.030
You don't need to worry about that.

17:21.500 --> 17:22.670
Is there a problem?

17:23.160 --> 17:24.000
Zhiyu.

17:25.720 --> 17:26.480
I'm afraid

17:26.880 --> 17:28.440
I couldn't make it.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.960
You couldn't make it when you were

17:31.960 --> 17:32.820
abroad before.

17:33.270 --> 17:34.720
But now you're back.

17:41.640 --> 17:42.600
I'm not...

17:44.240 --> 17:46.550
ready to visit your father's grave yet.

17:49.110 --> 17:50.310
You still resent him?

17:50.590 --> 17:52.400
He left without a word back then

17:53.700 --> 17:55.910
and left everything to me.

17:57.650 --> 17:59.110
How could I not resent him?

18:10.000 --> 18:10.880
Kanghua?

18:11.960 --> 18:12.920
Almost done.

18:13.360 --> 18:15.360
I'm with Zhiyu right now.

18:15.430 --> 18:17.030
Don't worry about me.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.200
Wait for me tonight.
Let's go back together...

18:20.200 --> 18:20.880
I have something to handle.

18:20.880 --> 18:21.940
I'll take my leave.

19:07.110 --> 19:07.790
Hu!

19:08.000 --> 19:09.270
You bought so many things.

19:09.270 --> 19:10.530
They're all for my dad.

19:11.480 --> 19:12.030
Madam.

19:12.590 --> 19:14.520
Can you grab those cherries for me?

19:14.680 --> 19:15.400
There you go.

19:15.400 --> 19:15.880
Be careful.

19:15.880 --> 19:16.810
It is a bit heavy.

19:25.200 --> 19:25.880
Hu.

19:26.680 --> 19:28.070
Who won today?

19:28.780 --> 19:30.060
We're drawing even.

19:49.440 --> 19:50.110
Mr. Xiao.

19:51.720 --> 19:53.470
You didn't go to the studio today.

19:53.470 --> 19:55.070
Did you go shopping instead?

19:56.790 --> 19:57.920
I accidentally

19:57.920 --> 19:59.510
dropped this bag on the ground.

19:59.510 --> 20:01.440
Do you want to check if it's broken?

20:01.480 --> 20:02.070
It's fine.

20:02.070 --> 20:03.030
I don't need it anyway.

20:03.030 --> 20:04.690
If you like it, you can take it.

20:05.070 --> 20:06.240
I can take it?

20:06.680 --> 20:07.880
What is it...

20:09.720 --> 20:10.960
I've seen this before.

20:10.960 --> 20:13.400
It's said to support
a painless blood glucose monitor.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.130
The ads are really hyping it up.

20:16.270 --> 20:17.160
Try it out.

20:27.310 --> 20:28.000
Mr. Xiao,

20:28.270 --> 20:29.920
I must be honest with you.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.750
This watch

20:30.750 --> 20:32.200
offers quite a lot of functions,

20:32.200 --> 20:34.350
but the watchband style is
way too old-fashioned,

20:34.350 --> 20:36.480
like something my parents would like.

20:36.920 --> 20:37.790
Forget it if you don't like it.

20:37.790 --> 20:38.440
Give it back to me.

20:38.440 --> 20:39.750
I haven't finished testing yet.

20:39.750 --> 20:40.480
Give it back.

20:40.920 --> 20:42.030
I'll return it to you
when I'm done testing.

20:42.030 --> 20:42.720
Give it to me. Come on.

20:42.720 --> 20:45.050
I'll give it back when I'm done testing...

21:00.470 --> 21:01.440
I think it's malfunctioning.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.170
Take it back.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.480
Dad.

21:25.310 --> 21:25.920
Xiu.

21:26.420 --> 21:27.770
Did you get everything?

21:28.400 --> 21:29.000
Don't worry.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.930
I bought everything you asked for.

21:31.050 --> 21:32.240
Get up early tomorrow.

21:32.240 --> 21:33.350
Don't delay anything.

21:33.350 --> 21:35.480
I won't delay. Just wait for me at home.

21:35.620 --> 21:36.160
Okay.

21:36.160 --> 21:38.160
There's nothing else. I'll hang up.

21:58.590 --> 21:59.520
Mr. Hu, Mrs. Bai.

22:00.240 --> 22:01.880
The car can't drive up here.

22:01.880 --> 22:02.720
Carrying so many things,

22:02.720 --> 22:03.790
you must be exhausted.

22:03.790 --> 22:05.400
Mr. Hu, would you like to take a break?

22:05.400 --> 22:06.800
It's okay. I'm not tired.

22:07.400 --> 22:09.190
Han Xuan, you're back from school?

22:09.190 --> 22:10.130
We're on vacation.

22:10.130 --> 22:11.300
I just got here yesterday.

22:11.300 --> 22:11.780
Come on.

22:13.000 --> 22:13.790
New Year's lucky money.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.960
Take it as an early gift from me.

22:14.960 --> 22:16.160
He's grown up now.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.480
There's no need to give him lucky money.

22:17.480 --> 22:18.640
But he's still a kid.

22:18.640 --> 22:20.550
College students need money to spend.
Take it.

22:20.550 --> 22:21.550
Thank you, Mr. Hu.

22:21.990 --> 22:22.990
Thank you, Mr. Hu.

22:25.790 --> 22:26.790
Let's go then.

22:26.790 --> 22:27.310
Okay.

22:29.980 --> 22:31.290
Xiu, let me carry that for you.

22:31.290 --> 22:31.820
Thanks.

22:33.550 --> 22:35.030
How's your new job?

22:35.680 --> 22:36.270
Not bad.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.240
No matter how busy you are at work,

22:38.240 --> 22:39.750
remember not to miss your meals.

22:39.750 --> 22:41.410
Now you're giving Xiu advice.

22:43.330 --> 22:44.790
You've grown even taller.

23:12.840 --> 23:13.510
Han,

23:14.550 --> 23:15.880
we've come to visit you.

23:19.040 --> 23:22.430
[Here rests Han Chuan]

23:49.550 --> 23:50.200
Mr. Hu,

23:50.480 --> 23:52.140
please take care of yourself.

23:53.030 --> 23:53.920
Mr. Hu,

23:54.210 --> 23:55.810
please don't mind me saying,

23:55.840 --> 23:57.790
but you should rest that leg more.

23:58.160 --> 23:59.270
Or it'll keep flaring up,

23:59.270 --> 24:01.200
and your knee won't heal properly.

24:02.790 --> 24:04.240
Compared to Han,

24:05.360 --> 24:07.560
my leg injury is nothing.

24:14.200 --> 24:14.710
Bro!

24:15.110 --> 24:16.030
The location of the distribution box

24:16.030 --> 24:17.400
and the wiring route have been set.

24:17.400 --> 24:19.400
You're so efficient with your work.

24:19.660 --> 24:20.150
Bro.

24:20.300 --> 24:22.600
Those dried fruits
you bought last time were so good.

24:22.600 --> 24:23.450
Where did you get them?

24:23.450 --> 24:24.250
Tasty, right?

24:24.590 --> 24:26.190
I'll buy some more tomorrow.

24:26.430 --> 24:27.760
My wife, Renzi, is picky about food.

24:27.760 --> 24:30.290
She loved these fruits
when she was pregnant.

24:30.350 --> 24:31.750
Okay. Thanks, bro.

24:32.000 --> 24:32.720
Come on!

24:32.720 --> 24:34.050
Why are you thanking me?

24:34.270 --> 24:35.590
I should be the one saying thank you.

24:35.590 --> 24:37.030
Your wife is pregnant now.

24:37.030 --> 24:37.400
Right?

24:37.400 --> 24:39.310
And you still agreed to work with me.

24:39.310 --> 24:40.270
To be honest,

24:40.470 --> 24:41.360
I'd feel uneasy

24:41.390 --> 24:42.520
if you weren't here.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.970
But who could have imagined

24:47.240 --> 24:49.080
that the stadium would collapse?

24:49.080 --> 24:50.540
The chief architect committed suicide

24:50.540 --> 24:51.990
and left everything behind.

24:51.990 --> 24:52.750
Yet Han

24:53.380 --> 24:55.490
didn't even get to see his child.

24:59.140 --> 24:59.780
Jerk!

24:59.940 --> 25:01.620
Suicide was too easy for you!

25:02.280 --> 25:04.810
Don't think suicide can exempt you
from responsibility!

25:04.810 --> 25:07.090
My husband is only 40!

25:07.310 --> 25:10.310
How are we, a widow and an orphan,
supposed to survive?

25:10.920 --> 25:12.920
You owe me my husband's life!

25:11.910 --> 25:14.160
[Qin Yuze's memorial service]

25:13.440 --> 25:15.030
You murderer!

25:20.200 --> 25:22.000
This isn't over just because he's dead!

25:22.000 --> 25:24.730
You, the Qin family,
must give us an explanation!

25:25.180 --> 25:26.780
Don't try to shirk the blame!

25:28.680 --> 25:29.160
Right!

25:29.240 --> 25:30.960
His family must atone for our losses!

25:30.960 --> 25:33.360
Otherwise, who will take responsibility?

25:59.110 --> 26:00.060
My dad asked me

26:00.590 --> 26:02.160
to come on behalf of him and Mrs. Xiao

26:02.160 --> 26:03.160
to pay respects.

26:15.470 --> 26:18.130
You are just as stubborn
as when you were a child.

26:28.000 --> 26:30.000
Unfortunately, there's something

26:30.060 --> 26:32.590
you can't solve
by throwing a temper tantrum.

26:35.830 --> 26:36.960
Don't you agree,

26:37.590 --> 26:39.310
Qin Xiaoyi?

26:49.190 --> 26:53.160
[Qin Yuze]

27:02.510 --> 27:03.790
So you're Qin Xiaoyi?

27:04.080 --> 27:05.510
Your younger brother has changed his name.

27:05.510 --> 27:06.720
He took my surname.

27:06.920 --> 27:08.250
He's called Xiao Zhiyu.

27:08.510 --> 27:09.200
From now on,

27:09.350 --> 27:11.680
you'll be the one to protect your brother.

27:14.030 --> 27:15.470
Starting today,

27:15.500 --> 27:17.560
do not call him by his old name anymore

27:17.600 --> 27:19.600
or tell anyone who his father is.

27:19.840 --> 27:20.570
Understand?

27:26.310 --> 27:27.570
I'll keep that in mind.

27:40.350 --> 27:41.830
After all these years,

27:42.550 --> 27:44.280
you dare not use your real name.

27:44.710 --> 27:46.720
You've changed your name,
but you can't let go of the past.

27:46.720 --> 27:49.440
So you can only use
the name "Qin Xiaoyi" in the game

27:49.440 --> 27:50.640
to comfort yourself.

27:51.380 --> 27:52.450
How pathetic.

28:04.880 --> 28:06.540
Be more careful in the future.

28:06.750 --> 28:09.280
The Pei family
has kept your secret for years.

28:09.680 --> 28:11.310
If your identity is exposed,

28:11.590 --> 28:13.250
and it gets Zhuling involved,

28:13.640 --> 28:15.170
I won't let you off the hook.

28:17.830 --> 28:18.560
By the way...

28:20.270 --> 28:21.750
If some people find out

28:22.310 --> 28:24.400
that you changed your name and identity

28:24.400 --> 28:26.200
to cover up the stains on you,

28:27.110 --> 28:29.440
will they still see you
the way they do now?

28:30.790 --> 28:31.960
With all that talk about justice,

28:31.960 --> 28:34.490
yet you,
the Peis, are the ones playing dirty.

28:35.160 --> 28:37.620
If there ever comes a day
when Zhuling falls,

28:38.600 --> 28:41.730
it should be the Pei family
bringing it upon themselves.

28:45.670 --> 28:47.130
What are you trying to say?

29:01.750 --> 29:02.350
Dad,

29:02.640 --> 29:03.840
I've sent the flowers

29:03.840 --> 29:04.880
as you told me to.

29:06.160 --> 29:06.960
Good.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.310
However,

29:10.020 --> 29:11.820
he didn't seem to appreciate it.

29:14.590 --> 29:16.290
As long as the flowers were delivered,

29:16.290 --> 29:17.690
and Wanyue can be at ease,

29:17.940 --> 29:18.800
that's enough.

29:26.420 --> 29:27.280
How's your waist?

29:27.280 --> 29:28.030
Feeling better now?

29:28.030 --> 29:28.830
Much better.

29:28.830 --> 29:31.350
Did you finish those treatments
at the Chinese medicine clinic?

29:31.350 --> 29:32.310
Not yet.

29:32.310 --> 29:34.960
Renzi, please don't spend extra money
on me anymore.

29:34.960 --> 29:35.840
It's fine.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.530
How was your semester?

29:42.760 --> 29:44.930
Just so-so, I think.

29:47.960 --> 29:48.640
Xuan,

29:49.360 --> 29:50.960
is something bothering you?

29:51.270 --> 29:52.310
Xiu, I...

29:52.920 --> 29:54.050
want to quit school.

29:56.070 --> 29:56.830
Why?

29:59.880 --> 30:00.350
Look,

30:00.380 --> 30:01.160
nowadays,

30:01.310 --> 30:03.070
the job market is so competitive,

30:03.070 --> 30:05.030
and I'm just from a second-tier college.

30:05.030 --> 30:07.510
I don't think I'll have any advantage
after graduation.

30:07.510 --> 30:10.440
I just want to start working
to gain some experience.

30:10.690 --> 30:11.690
The point is

30:11.820 --> 30:13.420
that my mom is getting older,

30:14.270 --> 30:16.350
and I can't bear to let her
continue working as a cleaner

30:16.350 --> 30:17.680
to pay for my schooling.

30:20.070 --> 30:21.330
Xuan, you've grown up.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.440
Xiu, do you

30:26.920 --> 30:27.830
support me?

30:28.720 --> 30:29.720
I understand you,

30:30.270 --> 30:31.670
but I don't support this.

30:32.270 --> 30:34.720
I still remember
how determined and exhilarated you were

30:34.720 --> 30:36.510
when you chose your major.

30:37.200 --> 30:38.240
Yes, but...

30:39.440 --> 30:41.570
I just think my mom is working too hard.

30:42.350 --> 30:43.960
I feel like she is stuck

30:43.960 --> 30:45.880
in this kind of life because of me.

30:47.310 --> 30:49.040
So you think if you drop out now,

30:49.200 --> 30:51.160
your mom will be relaxed and free?

30:52.670 --> 30:53.830
Isn't that the case?

30:55.790 --> 30:57.330
If you really drop out of school,

30:57.330 --> 30:59.260
that's when she'll truly be stuck.

31:00.310 --> 31:01.270
Trust me.

31:02.110 --> 31:03.750
No parent in this world

31:04.070 --> 31:05.960
would ever want their child
to give up their dreams

31:05.960 --> 31:07.160
for their sake.

31:14.100 --> 31:15.050
If only...

31:16.150 --> 31:18.480
If only that accident had never happened.

31:25.510 --> 31:27.200
That's all water under the bridge.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.960
We need to move on.

31:29.160 --> 31:29.750
Look,

31:30.000 --> 31:32.790
I also used to regret
not being able to study abroad.

31:32.790 --> 31:33.510
But now,

31:33.640 --> 31:36.100
I'm back doing architectural design again.

31:36.260 --> 31:38.590
Xuan, don't give up so easily, okay?

31:53.160 --> 31:54.720
If some people find out

31:55.200 --> 31:57.240
that you changed your name and identity

31:57.240 --> 31:59.070
to cover up the stains on you,

31:59.940 --> 32:02.270
will they still see you
the way they do now?

32:32.470 --> 32:33.530
Can't fall asleep?

32:38.680 --> 32:39.880
I had too much coffee.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.020
What about you?

32:44.070 --> 32:44.830
I...

32:46.070 --> 32:47.000
Same here.

32:48.000 --> 32:49.530
I can't fall asleep either.

32:57.620 --> 32:58.820
Check your phone.

33:01.510 --> 33:04.310
It's the song I listen to
when I need help sleeping.

33:04.550 --> 33:06.000
If you have trouble falling asleep,

33:06.000 --> 33:07.260
you could give it a try.

33:09.110 --> 33:10.510
Then why are you still up?

33:10.640 --> 33:12.200
I'm listening to it now.

33:13.790 --> 33:15.390
It just hasn't kicked in yet.

33:22.080 --> 33:27.110
♪ I saw the tram
driving under the sunset ♪

33:29.590 --> 33:34.350
♪ Like walking into a pause in a summer ♪

33:36.360 --> 33:39.330
♪ At this moment, the sunset is gentle ♪

33:40.160 --> 33:43.280
♪ I look up and press the shutter ♪

33:44.160 --> 33:51.380
♪ I take a piece of cloud
from your city as a memory ♪

33:52.330 --> 33:57.160
♪ Looking at the people
in skyscrapers leaving work ♪

33:57.590 --> 33:58.310
Mr. Xiao.

33:59.480 --> 34:04.630
♪ Leaving a hurried silhouette
for the dusk ♪

33:59.590 --> 34:01.030
If there's a chance,

34:01.790 --> 34:03.600
I can take you to their live show.

34:06.370 --> 34:09.469
♪ Talking about random topics ♪

34:08.370 --> 34:08.960
Okay.

34:10.139 --> 34:13.400
♪ Waiting for the traffic light at dusk ♪

34:14.090 --> 34:20.909
♪ To the left or to the right,
not about eternity ♪

34:21.480 --> 34:23.480
♪ I'm missing you so much ♪

34:23.580 --> 34:27.900
♪ And wondering what kind of life
you're living right now ♪

34:28.719 --> 34:33.510
♪ I can only hear about your recent life
through gossip ♪

34:36.510 --> 34:37.550
Mr. Wu, please.

34:38.710 --> 34:39.710
You're too kind.

34:41.550 --> 34:42.760
You can take it easy.

34:42.760 --> 34:44.760
We're just having tea and chatting.

34:45.670 --> 34:47.150
I've heard
that your factory is doing well lately.

34:47.150 --> 34:48.679
And you're even expanding.

34:49.800 --> 34:50.550
Thanks to our partnership

34:50.550 --> 34:52.150
with Zhuling in the past couple of years,

34:52.150 --> 34:53.960
the factory is finally on the right track.

34:53.960 --> 34:55.670
Though our business
has been okay these years,

34:55.670 --> 34:57.630
I still have to go seek orders myself.

34:57.630 --> 34:58.840
Everyone knows

34:58.840 --> 34:59.920
that companies with 3D printing

34:59.920 --> 35:01.440
and building material technology
in China are

35:01.440 --> 35:03.370
all Zhuling's business partners.

35:03.550 --> 35:05.190
I'm just riding on your coattails,

35:05.190 --> 35:07.150
barely surviving.

35:07.800 --> 35:09.600
You're being too modest, Mr. Wu.

35:10.550 --> 35:11.550
I heard

35:11.840 --> 35:14.370
that you're
taking on a big project recently.

35:17.630 --> 35:18.190
Mr. Pei,

35:18.910 --> 35:21.710
I've always valued our cooperation
with Zhuling.

35:22.190 --> 35:23.400
If there's anything you need,

35:23.400 --> 35:24.330
just let me know.

35:26.920 --> 35:27.720
Have some tea.

35:29.800 --> 35:30.600
It's my fault.

35:31.480 --> 35:33.000
I should have urged Lyman

35:33.000 --> 35:35.100
to push the cooperation process forward
with Mr. Wu.

35:35.100 --> 35:36.100
I never expected

35:36.440 --> 35:38.190
that even after we reached an agreement,

35:38.190 --> 35:39.650
they would still back out.

35:40.110 --> 35:42.070
They claimed to be unable
to meet the production demands.

35:42.070 --> 35:42.950
All excuses.

35:43.960 --> 35:45.070
I've contacted

35:45.070 --> 35:46.400
all 3D ceramic technology companies

35:46.400 --> 35:47.590
that I could find.

35:48.070 --> 35:49.230
But they all have deep cooperation

35:49.230 --> 35:50.590
with one company.

35:51.320 --> 35:52.480
As soon as I mentioned our project,

35:52.480 --> 35:53.840
they all politely declined.

35:53.840 --> 35:56.040
Seems like they were warned in advance.

35:56.730 --> 35:57.750
Zhuling.

35:59.830 --> 36:01.160
I've also asked around.

36:01.670 --> 36:02.670
Years ago, Zhuling started

36:02.670 --> 36:04.630
laying the groundwork
in the building materials sector,

36:04.630 --> 36:06.960
which led to its monopoly position today.

36:07.030 --> 36:08.590
But we can't let supply channels

36:08.590 --> 36:09.590
hold us back.

36:09.840 --> 36:11.320
Let's sort out a Plan B.

36:11.540 --> 36:12.460
For example,

36:12.480 --> 36:14.680
we could change the facade design plan.

36:17.120 --> 36:18.800
There is actually an alternative plan.

36:18.800 --> 36:19.590
-No.
-No way.

36:25.200 --> 36:26.800
The visual highlight of Lyman's projects

36:26.800 --> 36:29.400
exactly lies
in the facade's layers and textures.

36:29.400 --> 36:31.190
The 3D printed ceramic bricks can balance

36:31.190 --> 36:33.550
both the vintage vibe
and the modern deconstructivist design.

36:33.550 --> 36:34.550
Once we change the materials,

36:34.550 --> 36:36.280
all our efforts will be wasted.

36:36.840 --> 36:38.380
If we want to keep the design,

36:38.380 --> 36:39.470
there's another option.

36:39.470 --> 36:41.400
That is to cooperate with Zhuling.

36:47.290 --> 36:48.420
Meeting adjourned.

36:48.550 --> 36:49.630
I'll think it over.

37:09.280 --> 37:11.480
Xiao Zhiyu can't find a supply channel.

37:11.510 --> 37:12.630
And when it comes to design,

37:12.630 --> 37:14.880
he's the kind of person
who never compromises.

37:14.880 --> 37:15.760
At this point,

37:15.820 --> 37:17.230
he must be caught
between a rock and a hard place.

37:17.230 --> 37:18.000
This move of yours

37:18.000 --> 37:20.130
has really cut Xiao Zhiyu to the quick.

37:22.440 --> 37:24.840
I have no interest
in petty people gloating

37:25.370 --> 37:26.500
over their success.

37:43.300 --> 37:45.500
This one actually went out of business?

38:36.490 --> 38:37.220
Mr. Xiao!

38:38.310 --> 38:39.030
I-I'm sorry.

38:39.030 --> 38:40.560
I didn't know you were here.

38:41.280 --> 38:42.480
Why are you like a cat,

38:42.480 --> 38:43.960
walking without making any sound?

38:43.960 --> 38:45.160
The same goes for you.

38:45.270 --> 38:47.540
You jumped up pretty fast like a rabbit.

39:03.610 --> 39:04.810
Put some ice on it now.

39:16.630 --> 39:17.440
Does it hurt?

39:21.960 --> 39:23.490
I bumped into you that hard?

39:23.840 --> 39:24.840
What do you think?

39:41.120 --> 39:42.410
I-I'll do it myself.

39:48.000 --> 39:48.590
Mr. Xiao.

39:49.560 --> 39:50.290
I just

39:50.710 --> 39:52.070
found a small company

39:52.630 --> 39:53.920
that should be able to produce

39:53.920 --> 39:56.050
the 3D printed ceramic bricks we need.

39:56.280 --> 39:57.150
His company

39:57.150 --> 39:59.080
used to make 3D artistic ceramics.

39:59.430 --> 40:01.570
There's not much information available.

40:01.570 --> 40:03.960
All we know is that the owner
returned from Jingdezhen

40:03.960 --> 40:04.630
and has just entered

40:04.630 --> 40:06.840
the building materials field
in the past couple of years.

40:06.840 --> 40:08.990
This company may not be well-known,

40:09.070 --> 40:10.630
but its craftsmanship

40:10.660 --> 40:12.430
might meet our standards.

40:18.030 --> 40:19.830
Why aren't you saying anything?

40:20.670 --> 40:21.630
Is it

40:22.100 --> 40:22.910
not suitable?

40:26.840 --> 40:28.870
Factories with a background in crafts
like this one are

40:28.870 --> 40:30.080
generally small in scale

40:30.080 --> 40:31.880
and focus on quality over speed.

40:32.220 --> 40:33.410
For projects as big as Lyman's,

40:33.410 --> 40:36.540
they might not be able to keep up
with the supply demands.

40:39.630 --> 40:41.290
Your head hurts from the bump?

40:42.230 --> 40:43.480
I need to cool down.

40:44.520 --> 40:45.440
You're right.

40:45.960 --> 40:47.890
This production capacity issue is

40:48.110 --> 40:49.440
indeed very important.

40:57.460 --> 40:58.520
It's already 10 PM.

40:58.750 --> 40:59.610
Time to go home.

41:01.280 --> 41:02.400
Let's go home.

41:07.890 --> 41:08.560
Turn off the lights.
